- `find_latest_plan_file()`: >90% (cover main path + error handlers)
- `has_unambiguous_backlog_items()`: >85% (regex logic, multiple branches)
- `main()`: >80% (main logic + error handlers validated)

**Test Data**:
- Create fixture PLAN files with known TODO patterns
- Test files with various timestamp formats (valid/invalid)
- Test files with known backlog item counts

